                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Gooblins is a leaderboard driven wave based arcade game for the whole family. The UI is well done, the effects look great, and the game mechanics are original. The Gooblins, which look like some sort of alien species out of a kids movie, slowly close in while reacting to shots in their own distinct ways. Some of them dodge, some shoot back, and a few go kamikaze at high speeds. The sound effects warn when shots are coming, and the combo meter on the gun offers a fun way to earn more points. For a quick and fun arcade game that can be played with almost anyone, this is a great deal.",
